      <section class="section-centered-beige">
        <div class="sticky-container homepage sides">
          <div class="div-block-body left fix">
            <h2 class="heading-sections left">The operating system for knowledge work AI</h2>
            <p class="sub-heading sections left">The infrastructure, data, intelligence, and execution layers that makes the world’s data useful to AIs doing knowledge work</p>
            <div class="div-block-1655"><img src="images/Isometric-Seven-Layer-Digital-Platform-Diagram.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1254px) 100vw, 1254px" srcset="images/Isometric-Seven-Layer-Digital-Platform-Diagram-p-500.png 500w, images/Isometric-Seven-Layer-Digital-Platform-Diagram-p-800.png 800w, images/Isometric-Seven-Layer-Digital-Platform-Diagram-p-1080.png 1080w, images/Isometric-Seven-Layer-Digital-Platform-Diagram.png 1254w" alt="" class="image-714"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-1028">
            <div class="w-layout-hflex stacking-cards">
              <div class="w-layout-hflex boss-inner">
                <div class="w-layout-vflex flex-block-1029"><img width="26" loading="lazy" alt="" src="images/internet_2.svg" class="uc-steps-icon">
                  <h3 class="heading-cards">Bare Metal Infrastructure &amp; Web Access</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="sub-heading _14px">Web infrastructure for AI workloads, powered by bare metal servers, residential proxies, and headless browsers.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex stacking-cards">
              <div class="w-layout-hflex boss-inner">
                <div class="w-layout-vflex flex-block-1029"><img width="26" loading="lazy" alt="" src="images/cube-scan.svg" class="uc-steps-icon">
                  <h3 class="heading-cards">FBO Harness &amp; Data Integrations</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="sub-heading _14px">Connect AI systems to APIs, exclusive data sources, and third-party services through a unified API layer.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex stacking-cards">
              <div class="w-layout-hflex boss-inner">
                <div class="w-layout-vflex flex-block-1029"><img width="26" loading="lazy" alt="" src="images/search-window.svg" class="uc-steps-icon">
                  <h3 class="heading-cards">Web Data APIs</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="sub-heading _14px">Search, scrape, crawl, and extract structured web data to power AI applications, agents, and data pipelines.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex stacking-cards">
              <div class="w-layout-hflex boss-inner">
                <div class="w-layout-vflex flex-block-1029"><img width="26" loading="lazy" alt="" src="images/refresh-double.svg" class="uc-steps-icon">
                  <h3 class="heading-cards">Web Time Machine</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="sub-heading _14px">Build vertical Indexes with memory and search current and historical web data using a living index, snapshots, and temporal and composite queries.</p>
              </div>
